{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>For they are given, given.</b> They and their children — Israel gave them to Me, and I took them for Myself. The meaning is: I accepted them, and they were not given on account of the redemption of the firstborn of every womb. And פטרת and פטר are two forms, like צדקה and צדק, or according to a different pattern:"], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:51.002250499Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}